esigns\n   179→- **Gotcha**: Adding gradient fade background (`--gradient-fade`) creates subtle transitions between sections\n   180→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   181→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens, floating cards hidden on mobile\n   182→\n   183→---\n   184→\n   185→## 2025-02-08 - US-051\n   186→- Created complete website for Dra. Priscila Blazzi - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n   187→- Files changed:\n   188→  - `site-demo/dra-priscila-blazzi/index.html` (new)\n   189→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal Emerald & Silk aesthetic with deep emerald greens, silk cream backgrounds, and champagne gold accents. Fresh, sophisticated, and luxurious - a completely new direction from previous palettes (rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha). Geometric-elliptic shapes create modern, architectural take on blobmorphism.\n   190→- **Typography**: Bodoni Moda (display) paired with Source Sans 3 (body) for sophisticated, high-contrast elegance with modern readability\n   191→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   192→  - Animated hero with 4 floating elliptic backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   193→  - Geometric-elliptic border-radius patterns (`--radius-ellipse`, `--radius-ellipse-2`, `--radius-ellipse-3`) create architectural, modern shapes\n   194→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   195→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n   196→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   197→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars on emerald background\n   198→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   199→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   200→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   201→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   202→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   203→- **Contact Info**: Rua Thomaz Nogueira Gaia, 1090 - sala 01 e 02 - Jardim Sao Luiz, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14020-270 | (16) 99174-5408\n   204→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-priscila-blazzi\n   205→- **Verification**:\n   206→  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n   207→  - Mobile view responsive: ✓\n   208→  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n   209→  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n   210→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n   211→\n   212→**Learnings:**\n   213→- **Pattern**: Ethereal Emerald & Silk palette creates a fresh, sophisticated aesthetic that conveys luxury and renewal - perfect for aesthetic treatments emphasizing transformation and natural beauty\n   214→- **Pattern**: Geometric-elliptic shapes (`70% 30% / 30% 70% 70% 30%`) provide a more architectural, modern interpretation of blobmorphism that differentiates from purely organic shapes\n   215→- **Pattern**: Bodoni Moda as display font adds high-contrast sophistication and elegance - very different from the softer serif fonts used in previous sites\n   216→- **Gotcha**: The emerald-green palette feels more contemporary and fashion-forward while maintaining the premium positioning expected by aesthetic clinic clients\n   217→- **Gotcha**: Emerald tones suggest nature, renewal, and transformation - themes that align perfectly with facial harmonization treatments\n   218→- **Gotcha**: Silk cream backgrounds (`#F7F5F0`) provide warmth without being as yellow-based as champagne tones, creating a cleaner, more modern foundation\n   219→- **Gotcha**: Using emerald as the primary testimonial section background creates strong visual impact and reinforces brand identity\n   220→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   221→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens, floating cards hidden on mobile\n   222→\n   223→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n   224→- **Ethereal Emerald & Silk Palette**: `--color-emerald: #2D7A6E`, `--color-emerald-light: #4A9A8C`, `--color-emerald-dark: #1F5A52`, `--color-silk-cream: #F7F5F0`, `--color-champagne: #C9A86C` - sophisticated, luxurious aesthetic perfect for premium aesthetic clinics\n   225→- **Geometric-Elliptic Border Radius**: `--radius-ellipse: 70% 30% / 30% 70% 70% 30%` creates architectural, modern elliptic shapes that differentiate from organic blobs\n   226→- **Bodoni Moda + Source Sans 3 Typography**: High-contrast serif display font paired with clean, readable sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance\n   227→- **Opulent Rose & Quartz Palette**: `--color-rose: #C8758A`, `--color-rose-light: #D99AA8`, `--color-rose-dark: #A85D6E`, `--color-quartz: #E8D5E0`, `--color-rose-mist: #FDF0F3` - warm, luxurious crystalline aesthetic\n   228→- **Quartz Crystal Border Radius**: `--radius-quartz: 75% 25% / 35% 65% 65% 35%`, `--radius-quartz-2: 55% 45% / 65% 35% 45% 55%`, `--radius-quartz-3: 40% 60% / 55% 45% 35% 65%` for crystalline, geometric shapes\n   229→- **Cormorant Garamond + Outfit Typography**: Classic serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance\n   230→- **Amber & Bronze Noir Palette**: `--color-amber: #D48A3A`, `--color-amber-light: #E5A856`, `--color-amber-dark: #B86F1A`, `--color-bronze: #A67C42`, `--color-ivory: #FAF7F2` - warm, sophisticated amber/bronze tones on ivory backgrounds\n   231→- **Flame Border Radius**: `--radius-flame: 65% 35% 45% 55% / 55% 45% 55% 45%` creates organic flame-like shapes with distinctive flickering animation\n   232→- **Crimson Pro + DM Sans Typography**: Elegant serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated warmth\n   233→\n   234→---\n   235→